  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.<br>• In a small bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, the honey, a splash of water and a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Place pumpkin on the lined oven tray and pour over spice mixture. Toss to coat, then sprinkle with sesame seeds.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69116112806404b7ebc5b271/step-46f10900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop or crush garlic. <br>• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.<br>• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.<br>• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69116112806404b7ebc5b271/step-69ae7f10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Trim and halve green beans. Slice zucchini into thin rounds.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook green beans and zucchini until softened, 4-5 mins.<br>• Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Season to taste with  <br>salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69116112806404b7ebc5b271/step-b5773b20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a second small bowl, combine Japanese-style dressing and the mayonnaise.<br>• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with Japenese-style pumpkin and greens.<br>• Drizzle with mayo dressing to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69116112806404b7ebc5b271/step-da28b630.jpeg"
    }
  ]
